<Mod id="761aea79-2c11-4c3e-95e5-9b4b1879c4e5" version="4">
  <Properties>
    <Name>UI - City Religions</Name>
    <Teaser>Adds a popup showing religion and followers for all cities in the empire</Teaser>
    <Description>Displays religion and followers for all cities in the empire.

Permits buildings and units to be purchased with Faith in any city from a single summary screen</Description>
    <Authors>William Howard</Authors>
    <SpecialThanks>German translation: AndreP; EUI Icon: Lynnes</SpecialThanks>
